  "notes": "Compact 3-storey apartment block in warm cream render (#ddd0b0). Flat roof with a crenellated parapet of small merlon blocks along the top edge (expressed via a taller fascia plus a low top-terrace bar rail). Regular grid of dark windows (#4a4f45) with cream reveals; central ground entry. Timber slat boundary fence (#b08a52) to the street. Environment added 2026-07-05 from scene ref: a big date palm on a kerb planter island at centre, two more palms and a round oak plus a small bush and grass at the left, two dark cypresses (thin oaks) and distant round oaks at the right, a lamp post, a blue and a yellow wheelie bin, and four parked cars (silver, white SUV, silver, blue) along the right kerb. Colours pixel-sampled from the ref."
